// The cast's stand-in (M5 B1): a plain figure that proves a spec reaches the benchmark's cook, until M5 B3's
// cast. 1.6 m tall in a T-pose, facing +Z, its left toward +X, with KayKit's joint names. The cast writes it
// under its own folder, so `dir` here is replaced (`sapphire_pipeline::bench::cast`).
